      "text": "The function P is differentiable, and P(t) gives the number of people inside a stadium, in hundreds of people, at time t minutes. Selected values of P(t) are given in the table. Using the average rate of change of P over the interval \\( 2 \\le t \\le 11 \\), approximate \\( P'(5) \\). Give the exact value of the approximation and indicate units of measure.",
